The PCT503 is a ZigBee smart thermostat with a 3.5-inch TFT color LCD, smart rotary control and full multistage HVAC support.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA1.2, router device
- Supports 2H/2C multistage conventional and heat pump systems
- One-touch AWAY button to save energy
- 4-period and 7-day programming
- Multiple HOLD options
- Automatic heating and cooling changeover
- Fan cycle mode periodically circulates air for comfort
- Compressor short cycle protection delay
- Failure protection by cutting off all circuit relays after power outage
- 3.5" TFT color LCD with backlit status colors (red heat / blue cool / green fan)
- Screen lights up for 20 seconds when motion is detected
- Smart rotary control wheel + 3 side-buttons
- OTA firmware upgrade (optional, via WiFi)
